# The Expo mobile app is a separate project with its own TS/toolchain; the
# root (web) ESLint config cannot parse its .tsx files. It lints itself.
# Anchored to the repo root - an unanchored `mobile` also matches
# server/services/mobile/ and test/server/services/mobile/, silently
# excluding them from lint too.
/mobile
